    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi></math> be a positive real number. Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mo>:</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8477;</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8477;</mi></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi><mo>:</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8734;</mo></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8477;</mi></math>&nbsp;be the functions defined by&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mn>12</mn></mfrac></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mfenced><mrow><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mi>&#945;</mi></msqrt></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><msqrt><mi>&#945;</mi></msqrt></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></math>.<br />Then the value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow></munder><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is ______."
  },
